      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹8.81 (vs ₹8.96 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹8.81 (down from ₹8.96 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹668.9m (down 7.8% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹45.1m (down 1.7% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.7% (up from 6.3% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 34% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 15% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
